OL,3,GNEWSACommunity crochets 1,000 poppies
OL,4,Afor Remembrance Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 hand-crocheted poppies
OL,7,Fare on display at a community centre
OL,8,Fahead of Remembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FMembers of the Hookey Crochet Club at
OL,11,FJohn White Community Centre in Binley,
OL,12,FCoventry, spent months making the
OL,13,Fpoppies.
OL,15,FThe display, called Poppies for
OL,16,FRemembrance, also marks the 20th
OL,17,Fanniversary of the centre opening its
OL,18,Fdoors.
OL,20,FThe centre's chairwoman, 86-year-old
OL,21,FMary Hollins, came up with the idea to
OL,22,Fcelebrate the milestone.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
